    <string name="kuma3_cal_fsrs">FSRS is being tested on reviews it was not trained on (once per test fold, as on the desktop). Time left: %s.</string>
    <string name="kuma3_cal_rwkv">RWKV is going through your whole history once (%1$d%%). Time left: %2$s. Until it is done, reviews use the standard order; you can leave the statistics.</string>
